# Zikrist continuity (local Cursor)

Applies to this whole repo when opened in Cursor (Agent / Composer / Cloud Agent), not only Grok Bot. Do not wait for a pasted prompt.

**Execution style:** Jump straight to execution. Do not announce a plan, echo a mantra, recite docs, or use canned confirmation phrases (e.g. never say "I'll read Tip state and product docs..."). Tip / `AGENTS.md` / these rules are silent internal reads. First user-visible action is a code edit, file write, test run, or terminal command.

## Start of every coding session (silent)

1. Silently read `HANDOFF.md` **Tip state** only first. Do not recite it in chat.
2. Then `AGENTS.md` (silent).
3. Then **only** the open-track prompt named in Tip (silent).
4. If Tip is recognition / algo / follower / replay: also obey `.cursor/rules/zikrist-recognition-ratchet.mdc` and skim `prompts/real-imam/algo/PRODUCT-BAR.md` + `RATCHET.md` (do not load every `prompts/**` file; do not announce this skim).
5. Restore fixtures if missing: `npm run fixtures:recitation` then `npm run fixtures:imam`.

Skip overnight queues unless picking next work.

Write obligation (do not paste it here, do not recite it): follow **Dictation for successor bots** in `HANDOFF.md` and `prompts/_SHARED-HANDOFF.md` exactly.

## Before finishing any change set / PR

- Always bump `HANDOFF.md` Tip state in the **same PR**. **Your session is incomplete without that bump.** CI requires `HANDOFF.md` in the diff.
- Update `VALIDATION.md` when Mac/Linux verify paths change or you record a new Mac-green result.
- Update queue status (`prompts/**/00-QUEUE.md`) when that overnight track moves.
- Recognition fixes: permanent **ratchet lock** same PR (unit and/or ready expect) per `prompts/real-imam/algo/RATCHET.md`.
- After any change under `src/core/` or `src/services/`, regenerate `zikrist_pipeline_export.txt` with `npm run pipeline:export` in the **same change set**. Do not leave that dump stale.

## Hard limits

- `npm run test:replay -- all` stays **14/14** Quran when claiming floor-green (record honest N/14 if red). Linux ONNX is not that gate.
- Algo/follower Tip work also needs the **product bar** in `prompts/real-imam/algo/PRODUCT-BAR.md` (lock + ordered advance + correct Arabic mushaf on the Tip clip). 14/14 alone ≠ done.
- **After any recognition/follower/Tilawa-patch change on Mac:** the editing agent runs the Agent verify loop in `PRODUCT-BAR.md` and reports findings in-chat + tip. Do not defer acoustic verify to founder iOS vibe-testing.
- **Ratchet:** `prompts/real-imam/algo/RATCHET.md` — fix → Mac measure → permanent unit/ready lock in the same PR. Do not weaken expects. Known fails only shrink when locked. Corpus only grows.
- Never invent ayah labels.
- Do not flip real-imam `stub` → `ready` except in a label-fill session after Mac `test:replay -- <suite>` PASS. Mid-surah-cold false-lock is already Mac-green (#17).
- Do not commit `artifacts/` audio (wav/mp3).
- Do not add network / translation-SQLite / pack-download tests to default `npm test`.
